## Article 144. Enforcement of court decisions

```catala
declaration scope Article144Enforcement:
  input decisionFinal content YesNo
  input decisionSubjectToEnforcement content YesNo
  output canEnforce content YesNo

scope Article144Enforcement:
  label enforce_default definition canEnforce equals No

# Only final decisions can be enforced
  label enforce_final exception enforce_default
  definition canEnforce under condition
    decisionFinal = Yes
    and decisionSubjectToEnforcement = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Article 145. Immediate enforcement

```catala
declaration scope Article145ImmediateEnforcement:
  input caseActsRegardingMinors content YesNo
  input caseActsRegardingRestoration content YesNo
  input courtSpecifiedImmediateEnforcement content YesNo
  output subjectToImmediateEnforcement content YesNo

scope Article145ImmediateEnforcement:
  label immediate_default definition subjectToImmediateEnforcement equals No

# Cases regarding minors → immediate
  label immediate_minors exception immediate_default
  definition subjectToImmediateEnforcement under condition
    caseActsRegardingMinors = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

# Acts about restoration of rights → immediate
  label immediate_restoration exception immediate_default
  definition subjectToImmediateEnforcement under condition
    caseActsRegardingRestoration = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

# Court explicitly orders immediate enforcement
  label immediate_court_order exception immediate_default
  definition subjectToImmediateEnforcement under condition
    courtSpecifiedImmediateEnforcement = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Article 146. Enforcement measures

```catala
declaration scope Article146EnforcementMeasures:
  input enforcement content EnforcementMeasure
  input defendantNonCompliant content YesNo
  output enforcementMeasureAvailable content YesNo

scope Article146EnforcementMeasures:
  label available_default definition enforcementMeasureAvailable equals No

  label available_fine exception available_default
  definition enforcementMeasureAvailable under condition
    enforcement.action = MonetaryFine
    and defendantNonCompliant = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label available_compulsory exception available_default
  definition enforcementMeasureAvailable under condition
    enforcement.action = CompulsoryExecution
    and defendantNonCompliant = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label available_seizure exception available_default
  definition enforcementMeasureAvailable under condition
    enforcement.action = PropertySeizure
    and defendantNonCompliant = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label available_freeze exception available_default
  definition enforcementMeasureAvailable under condition
    enforcement.action = AccountFreeze
    and defendantNonCompliant = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Article 147. Court fines for non-compliance

```catala
declaration scope Article147CourtFines:
  input defendantIsPublicAuthority content YesNo
  input nonComplianceDurationDays content integer
  input repeatedNonCompliance content YesNo
  output fineAmountMinimums content integer
  output fineCanIncrease content YesNo

scope Article147CourtFines:
# Base fine for public authority non-compliance
  label fine_base definition fineAmountMinimums under condition
    defendantIsPublicAuthority = Yes
    and nonComplianceDurationDays > 0
    consequence equals 50

# Repeated non-compliance increases fine
  label fine_repeated definition fineAmountMinimums under condition
    defendantIsPublicAuthority = Yes
    and repeatedNonCompliance = Yes
    consequence equals 100

  label fine_increase definition fineCanIncrease under condition
    repeatedNonCompliance = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label fine_no_increase definition fineCanIncrease under condition
    repeatedNonCompliance = No
    consequence equals No
```

## Articles 148-149. Enforcement deadlines and appeals

```catala
declaration scope Article148EnforcementDeadline:
  input enforcement content EnforcementMeasure
  output enforcementDeadlineDays content integer

scope Article148EnforcementDeadline:
  label deadline_30 definition enforcementDeadlineDays under condition
    enforcement.action = CompulsoryExecution
    consequence equals 30

  label deadline_15 definition enforcementDeadlineDays under condition
    enforcement.action = MonetaryFine
    consequence equals 15

  label deadline_10 definition enforcementDeadlineDays under condition
    enforcement.action = AccountFreeze
    consequence equals 10

  label deadline_default definition enforcementDeadlineDays under condition
    enforcement.action = PropertySeizure
    consequence equals 30
```
